WEBVTT

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:01.280
Ta-da.

00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:04.730
It's an invitation to the land god festival.

00:00:05.070 --> 00:00:07.460
It only happens once a year.

00:00:07.460 --> 00:00:09.730
Yamada-san the oni gave it to me.

00:00:10.230 --> 00:00:13.400
You've been kind of down 
since you hurt your arm.

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:13.960
You should...

00:00:13.960 --> 00:00:15.110
I'm not going.

00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:17.240
I don't want to go.

00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:18.730
Tazuki...

00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:53.460
#11
I Want to Be 
With You Forever and Ever

00:01:51.450 --> 00:01:53.590
You guys believe me, right? See?

00:01:57.270 --> 00:01:58.840
It's just a dog.

00:01:59.540 --> 00:02:02.190
That's what Tanaka said, too!

00:02:02.190 --> 00:02:04.210
Well, it is a normal dog.

00:02:04.210 --> 00:02:05.380
It's not!

00:02:05.380 --> 00:02:07.730
It disappeared after I 
took this picture, too!

00:02:08.620 --> 00:02:11.270
It floated away and vanished 
like smoke, right?

00:02:11.270 --> 00:02:11.860
Yeah!

00:02:12.230 --> 00:02:14.000
You must have been seeing things.

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:15.010
Or dreaming.

00:02:15.010 --> 00:02:17.110
It was hurt! It was bleeding!

00:02:17.990 --> 00:02:22.140
I bet it's the restless spirit of 
a dog that was hit by a car.

00:02:22.140 --> 00:02:25.370
Holy crap, that's scary! Bachiyama's scary!

00:02:25.370 --> 00:02:26.660
Bachiyama?

00:02:26.660 --> 00:02:29.250
It's a small mountain near where I live.

00:02:29.250 --> 00:02:32.590
They say anyone who goes inside gets cursed.

00:02:32.590 --> 00:02:34.500
That's where I found this guy.

00:02:36.080 --> 00:02:37.810
You aren't interested at all?!

00:02:38.750 --> 00:02:40.440
What are you reading, Tanaka?

00:02:40.440 --> 00:02:41.510
A kanji dictionary.

00:02:45.310 --> 00:02:47.520
Huh, an inugami?

00:02:47.730 --> 00:02:49.520
It looks like a normal dog.

00:02:49.890 --> 00:02:51.710
I think it's just a puppy still.

00:02:52.260 --> 00:02:56.090
Mature ones can take human form and talk.

00:02:56.090 --> 00:02:58.070
He said it was hurt.

00:02:58.070 --> 00:03:02.030
Someone might have chased it into Bachiyama.

00:03:03.670 --> 00:03:06.070
Hey, want to go look for it?

00:03:07.230 --> 00:03:09.660
I feel like we should do something.

00:03:10.910 --> 00:03:12.080
You're right.

00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:12.900
Let's go.

00:03:14.930 --> 00:03:16.420
Really, Tacchan?

00:03:16.620 --> 00:03:18.430
It's too late to start today.

00:03:18.430 --> 00:03:19.840
How about tomorrow?

00:03:19.840 --> 00:03:23.430
We should talk to the god 
if we're going after school.

00:03:23.430 --> 00:03:24.290
Yeah.

00:03:26.840 --> 00:03:28.180
<i>This is a surprise.</i>

00:03:29.450 --> 00:03:31.810
I told you to just leave him be.
Don't you understand?

00:03:38.360 --> 00:03:41.390
<i>It was a miracle that he 
even went to look for Conny.</i>

00:03:41.810 --> 00:03:43.830
<i>I thought he'd resist.</i>

00:03:56.890 --> 00:03:58.120
Soraino.

00:03:58.660 --> 00:04:01.650
I'd forgotten, I can't sleep yet.

00:04:01.650 --> 00:04:03.600
I mustn't sleep.

00:04:03.600 --> 00:04:05.340
Huh? Wh-Why?

00:04:05.690 --> 00:04:08.760
There's a foreign drama that 
I wanted to see tonight.

00:04:11.750 --> 00:04:13.390
Is this the right channel?

00:04:13.390 --> 00:04:14.260
It is.

00:04:16.420 --> 00:04:19.050
You can head to bed, Soraino.

00:04:19.050 --> 00:04:20.230
I'll watch, too.

00:04:20.230 --> 00:04:22.010
I couldn't sleep anyway.

00:04:22.010 --> 00:04:22.990
Soraino...

00:04:23.610 --> 00:04:27.240
Besides, you can't control the 
remote by yourself, can you, Aayan?

00:04:27.240 --> 00:04:28.490
Indeed!

00:04:38.250 --> 00:04:40.450
What's wrong with Mii?

00:04:40.450 --> 00:04:43.010
He really doesn't want to be left here.

00:04:43.430 --> 00:04:45.130
What happened was, last night,

00:04:45.570 --> 00:04:49.470
he woke up from a nightmare, 
and I wasn't there.

00:04:53.930 --> 00:04:56.840
He's been like this all day.

00:04:56.840 --> 00:04:58.900
He's in baby mode.

00:05:02.280 --> 00:05:05.390
It wouldn't be good if we forced him to stay,

00:05:05.390 --> 00:05:07.910
and he left to go after Sora.

00:05:08.390 --> 00:05:10.830
Want to stay together today, Mii-kun?

00:05:20.610 --> 00:05:22.020
Wh-What was that cutout?

00:05:22.020 --> 00:05:23.200
It's gone.

00:05:23.200 --> 00:05:24.720
It's nothing to be afraid of.

00:05:24.720 --> 00:05:26.550
It's like a tag.

00:05:28.720 --> 00:05:30.810
Thank you, god.

00:05:34.230 --> 00:05:35.230
Hey, Tazuki,

00:05:35.730 --> 00:05:39.430
it's summer break after 
our search today, right?

00:05:39.430 --> 00:05:41.160
Let's all go hang out.

00:05:41.160 --> 00:05:41.980
Okay.

00:05:41.980 --> 00:05:43.290
Yay.

00:05:43.290 --> 00:05:45.490
I'll ask the other two, too, then.

00:05:45.920 --> 00:05:47.820
Isn't that great, Mii-kun?

00:05:47.820 --> 00:05:49.990
I hope all our schedules line up.

00:05:50.400 --> 00:05:52.830
We probably won't be able to 
go anywhere once we graduate.

00:05:55.240 --> 00:05:59.320
Are you trying to say we won't 
meet up with you anymore?

00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:10.000
I'm kidding.

00:06:11.190 --> 00:06:13.080
Let's clean up and head home.

00:06:13.520 --> 00:06:15.180
We're going to the mountain, aren't we?

00:06:15.940 --> 00:06:16.740
Yeah.

00:06:22.070 --> 00:06:24.310
It's so pretty here.

00:06:24.310 --> 00:06:26.850
It looks like any other mountain.

00:06:26.850 --> 00:06:34.410
The strange creatures might be spreading 
scary rumors to keep people away.

00:06:34.810 --> 00:06:36.830
Huh? What for?

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:39.420
To protect their own home.

00:06:39.960 --> 00:06:43.670
You know how people avoid places 
that have stories about them?

00:06:44.300 --> 00:06:46.260
Everyone just wants to live in peace.

00:06:48.610 --> 00:06:50.180
There's a fork in the path.

00:06:54.390 --> 00:06:56.010
Want to split up?

00:06:56.010 --> 00:06:57.500
Let's pick a time to meet back up.

00:06:57.500 --> 00:06:58.570
Good idea.

00:06:59.270 --> 00:07:02.160
Oh, it's the summer solstice today.

00:07:02.760 --> 00:07:03.940
Oh, yeah, it is.

00:07:04.790 --> 00:07:07.360
<i>Summer solstice...</i>

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:09.190
<i>I feel like there was something about today.</i>

00:07:13.610 --> 00:07:15.080
<i>What was it, again?</i>

00:07:15.450 --> 00:07:17.240
Hey!

00:07:17.240 --> 00:07:19.290
Inugami-san!

00:07:19.290 --> 00:07:21.220
Inugami!

00:07:21.220 --> 00:07:22.960
Hey!

00:07:24.950 --> 00:07:27.080
It's so quiet on this mountain.

00:07:28.250 --> 00:07:30.090
You can't even hear any echoes.

00:07:32.240 --> 00:07:33.700
<i>Weird...</i>

00:07:33.700 --> 00:07:36.350
<i>I don't see any creatures at all, 
let alone the inugami.</i>

00:07:40.920 --> 00:07:44.860
Hey, Sora-kun, did something 
happen between you and Kami-kun?

00:07:48.250 --> 00:07:51.200
You guys weren't talking at all earlier.

00:07:52.990 --> 00:07:55.430
We both kind of said 
things we shouldn't have.

00:07:55.770 --> 00:07:57.870
We just feel like we screwed up.

00:08:00.190 --> 00:08:02.500
It's my fault, to be honest.

00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:06.180
Hey!

00:08:06.180 --> 00:08:08.310
Inugami-kun!

00:08:08.310 --> 00:08:09.400
Hey!

00:08:09.400 --> 00:08:10.650
There's nothing here.

00:08:11.810 --> 00:08:14.890
Something's off that 
there'd be so little here.

00:08:15.090 --> 00:08:16.640
Really?

00:08:16.640 --> 00:08:18.140
Thursday, June 21

00:08:18.800 --> 00:08:19.960
Let's go back.

00:08:22.910 --> 00:08:24.270
How was it?

00:08:24.270 --> 00:08:24.900
Did you find it?

00:08:25.770 --> 00:08:27.650
No, we didn't.

00:08:28.010 --> 00:08:30.130
We couldn't find it, either.

00:08:30.130 --> 00:08:32.710
We couldn't find a single animal, in fact.

00:08:32.710 --> 00:08:34.560
We didn't find anything, either.

00:08:35.810 --> 00:08:37.160
Isn't that weird?

00:08:37.420 --> 00:08:39.280
Yeah, it's weird.

00:08:39.730 --> 00:08:42.330
Mii-kun, want to go in my pocket?

00:08:44.310 --> 00:08:45.510
Let's leave.

00:08:45.510 --> 00:08:48.010
Something might happen 
once the sun goes down.

00:08:51.940 --> 00:08:52.890
Sora-kun?

00:08:52.890 --> 00:08:53.750
What's up?

00:08:54.850 --> 00:08:59.140
Hey, did something just <i>shift</i>?

00:09:00.410 --> 00:09:01.110
Hey.

00:09:02.430 --> 00:09:03.920
It's turned into a single path.

00:09:10.240 --> 00:09:11.780
Wh-What the...?

00:09:11.940 --> 00:09:13.410
Festival music?

00:09:15.580 --> 00:09:16.830
<i>Summer solstice...</i>

00:09:16.830 --> 00:09:18.320
<i>Festival music...</i>

00:09:18.320 --> 00:09:19.410
<i>A festival.</i>

00:09:23.040 --> 00:09:27.170
We couldn't go last year, but want to 
go to the land god festival this year?

00:09:27.900 --> 00:09:31.340
Yamada-san got us invitations again.

00:09:32.890 --> 00:09:36.640
Let's stop getting involved in that stuff.

00:09:37.720 --> 00:09:43.150
I think we should find other 
friends and humans to play with.

00:09:45.680 --> 00:09:49.310
<i>Tazuki's words stuck with 
me more than the festival.</i>

00:09:50.160 --> 00:09:52.320
<i>That it's none of his business.</i>

00:09:52.880 --> 00:09:54.600
<i>I'd totally forgotten.</i>

00:09:55.270 --> 00:09:56.180
This is bad.

00:09:57.830 --> 00:09:59.920
We wandered into the festival.

00:09:59.920 --> 00:10:01.330
The land god's festival.

00:10:02.070 --> 00:10:06.080
It's a special festival that 
happens on the summer solstice.

00:10:06.330 --> 00:10:07.830
A festival, huh?

00:10:07.830 --> 00:10:09.220
There must be someone we know, then—

00:10:09.220 --> 00:10:11.340
It's not enough to have an acquaintance.

00:10:11.690 --> 00:10:14.670
It's not allowed for someone 
who wasn't invited to enter.

00:10:15.990 --> 00:10:18.090
It's a no-humans festival.

00:10:19.930 --> 00:10:21.360
Humans.

00:10:26.130 --> 00:10:27.350
When did...

00:10:28.010 --> 00:10:29.600
Present your invitations.

00:10:32.080 --> 00:10:33.110
I'll handle this.

00:10:34.220 --> 00:10:37.880
<i>Then again, it's no use lying.</i>

00:10:38.210 --> 00:10:40.610
<i>And there's no point telling the truth.</i>

00:10:42.320 --> 00:10:46.600
I'm sorry, we got lost and wandered in here.

00:10:46.960 --> 00:10:48.500
So we don't have...

00:10:48.500 --> 00:10:50.250
You don't have invitations?

00:10:54.260 --> 00:10:55.630
Unforgivable.

00:11:00.750 --> 00:11:06.520
A human entering our sacred 
festival without an invitation

00:11:06.520 --> 00:11:08.480
calls for punishment.

00:11:08.480 --> 00:11:10.370
Can't it be just me

00:11:10.930 --> 00:11:12.870
who gets punished?

00:11:15.650 --> 00:11:18.000
I'll do anything.

00:11:18.000 --> 00:11:20.650
You can work me to death or sacrifice me.

00:11:21.110 --> 00:11:23.910
So could you please let the others go?

00:11:26.900 --> 00:11:28.660
What the hell are you talking about?

00:11:33.630 --> 00:11:36.810
What an amusing human,

00:11:37.520 --> 00:11:38.920
but I won't allow it.

00:11:38.920 --> 00:11:39.840
Sora-chan!

00:11:54.000 --> 00:11:54.900
Stop!

00:12:03.050 --> 00:12:05.370
Prepare yourselves, all of you!

00:12:08.020 --> 00:12:08.920
Wh-What the...?

00:12:10.250 --> 00:12:11.170
Mii-kun!

00:12:11.170 --> 00:12:12.420
Get off me, fool!

00:12:12.420 --> 00:12:13.620
Get off!

00:12:14.710 --> 00:12:18.250
Oh, you <i>do</i> have invitations.

00:12:19.420 --> 00:12:21.720
One, two, three, four...

00:12:21.720 --> 00:12:23.510
You have enough for all of you.

00:12:27.930 --> 00:12:30.890
You could have avoided that if 
you'd presented them sooner.

00:12:31.150 --> 00:12:32.180
Mii-kun!

00:12:32.180 --> 00:12:34.140
You need to be more careful!

00:12:37.560 --> 00:12:40.730
If you have invitations, that changes things.

00:12:40.730 --> 00:12:42.480
Thank you for coming.

00:12:42.480 --> 00:12:44.570
Have plenty of fun.

00:12:45.430 --> 00:12:46.910
<i>We're saved?</i>

00:12:53.960 --> 00:12:55.910
Knock it off!

00:12:55.910 --> 00:12:58.210
You always do things for your own sake.

00:13:01.590 --> 00:13:02.490
Tacchan.

00:13:02.490 --> 00:13:03.340
Wait.

00:13:04.070 --> 00:13:05.990
I'm going to go talk to him alone for a bit.

00:13:12.520 --> 00:13:13.600
Tazuki!

00:13:13.600 --> 00:13:14.600
Come on, Tazuki!

00:13:16.730 --> 00:13:18.850
Why did you snap like that?

00:13:18.850 --> 00:13:21.730
Did I do something to make you angry?

00:13:22.220 --> 00:13:23.100
You need to explain.

00:13:23.100 --> 00:13:24.510
Sora?

00:13:24.510 --> 00:13:26.490
It's you, isn't it?

00:13:26.490 --> 00:13:27.680
Yamada-san.

00:13:27.680 --> 00:13:29.920
Long time no see, kid.

00:13:30.880 --> 00:13:33.030
You've grown so big.

00:13:33.030 --> 00:13:35.020
You're even more adorable than before.

00:13:35.370 --> 00:13:36.410
You're killing me.

00:13:35.370 --> 00:13:37.200
Terribly adorable.

00:13:36.410 --> 00:13:38.130
Yamada-san, you're killing me.

00:13:39.280 --> 00:13:41.380
Oh? Who's this here?

00:13:41.520 --> 00:13:42.640
That's Tazuki.

00:13:42.640 --> 00:13:44.170
My friend Tazuki.

00:13:44.170 --> 00:13:46.110
Nice to meet you.

00:13:46.110 --> 00:13:49.140
Oh, you're the Tazukinbou.

00:13:49.420 --> 00:13:52.040
Adorable. Adorable, indeed.

00:13:52.730 --> 00:13:55.640
Yamada-san, could you 
cut him a break, please?

00:13:55.640 --> 00:13:57.770
Oh, my bad.

00:13:58.120 --> 00:14:01.640
So you finally made it to the festival, huh?

00:14:01.640 --> 00:14:03.270
I'm so happy.

00:14:03.270 --> 00:14:04.690
Oh, right.

00:14:05.670 --> 00:14:09.150
<i>Those invitations were the ones 
Yamada-san gave me a long time ago.</i>

00:14:10.040 --> 00:14:11.460
What's up, Sorabou?

00:14:12.780 --> 00:14:17.110
Hey, we came to this mountain 
looking for an inugami.

00:14:17.110 --> 00:14:18.460
An inugami?

00:14:18.460 --> 00:14:20.200
Have you seen one anywhere?

00:14:20.200 --> 00:14:22.160
It has a rope around its neck.

00:14:22.160 --> 00:14:23.710
It looks like it's hurt.

00:14:23.950 --> 00:14:26.660
Oh, you mean Aa and Uu.

00:14:26.660 --> 00:14:27.920
Aa and Uu?

00:14:27.920 --> 00:14:29.100
They went over...

00:14:29.100 --> 00:14:31.100
Sora-kun! Kami-kun!

00:14:34.810 --> 00:14:36.310
<b>Crackle!</b>

00:14:36.390 --> 00:14:38.170
Oh, I'll introduce you.

00:14:38.170 --> 00:14:39.980
Those are my friends, Mogi-chan and Daichi.

00:14:39.980 --> 00:14:41.730
How adorable!

00:14:44.370 --> 00:14:47.740
Sorry, Yamada-san just loves humans.

00:14:49.540 --> 00:14:52.120
I took care of Aa this morning,

00:14:52.570 --> 00:14:55.770
and took them to Uu a bit earlier.

00:14:55.770 --> 00:14:59.000
So, Yamada-san, who're Aa and Uu?

00:14:59.420 --> 00:15:02.070
Those are the names I gave the inugami.

00:15:02.070 --> 00:15:04.110
There are two of them, so I called them A-Un.

00:15:04.110 --> 00:15:05.860
Oh, I see.

00:15:05.860 --> 00:15:08.060
You mean Aa and Uu, as in A-Un?

00:15:08.060 --> 00:15:12.140
A-Un, as in the beginning 
and end of everything.

00:15:12.590 --> 00:15:17.390
The foo dogs at the entrance 
of a shrine represent the A-Un.

00:15:17.620 --> 00:15:18.850
I see.

00:15:18.850 --> 00:15:21.010
So it's Aa-kun and Uu-kun.

00:15:21.010 --> 00:15:22.900
Are they both safe?

00:15:23.380 --> 00:15:25.400
They're safe, in a way,

00:15:25.840 --> 00:15:29.780
but they were both seen 
by humans a few days ago.

00:15:30.200 --> 00:15:34.010
Aa apparently bought Uu time to escape.

00:15:34.250 --> 00:15:36.540
It looks like Aa managed to escape, too,

00:15:37.060 --> 00:15:39.220
but Uu was crying like mad.

00:15:39.220 --> 00:15:41.130
It wasn't getting anywhere.

00:15:43.720 --> 00:15:46.830
You kids were looking for Aa, on the right.

00:15:46.830 --> 00:15:49.170
Its other half, Uu, is the one on the left.

00:15:49.610 --> 00:15:52.080
Good, it looks like they're calming dow—

00:16:01.790 --> 00:16:03.310
You're going that way?

00:16:03.510 --> 00:16:06.710
Oh, man, it's a huge fight.

00:16:09.340 --> 00:16:10.930
We'll handle this.

00:16:13.770 --> 00:16:16.090
<i>I've managed to chase it down,</i>

00:16:16.090 --> 00:16:18.160
<i>but I don't know what to 
do about all this crying.</i>

00:16:19.200 --> 00:16:20.280
Mii-kun?

00:16:24.560 --> 00:16:29.920
Hey, Aa-kun, are you crying so 
much because Uu-kun bit you?

00:16:31.590 --> 00:16:33.680
Because you made Uu-kun cry?

00:16:36.550 --> 00:16:37.520
Yeah, huh?

00:16:38.840 --> 00:16:43.480
Actually, I just did what you 
did, and my friend punched me.

00:16:44.320 --> 00:16:46.950
I got really upset because 
it came out of nowhere.

00:16:46.950 --> 00:16:49.980
I confronted him, asking him why he hit me.

00:16:50.750 --> 00:16:54.400
It's obvious when you think about it.

00:16:55.460 --> 00:16:57.850
I did something for the sake of my friends,

00:16:58.400 --> 00:17:00.950
and I ended up hurting them instead.

00:17:14.610 --> 00:17:17.050
Mii-kun, sorry about what I did.

00:17:17.850 --> 00:17:20.650
I know what it's like to worry for someone.

00:17:21.280 --> 00:17:23.060
I just can't do things right.

00:17:25.500 --> 00:17:27.520
Let's go see Uu-kun together.

00:17:28.950 --> 00:17:30.440
I think it went this way.

00:17:32.920 --> 00:17:33.940
What's that noise?

00:17:38.330 --> 00:17:38.950
Yo.

00:17:42.220 --> 00:17:46.090
You aren't going to solve 
anything by hurting yourself.

00:17:47.550 --> 00:17:50.940
It just makes it worse when 
you know how they feel,

00:17:50.940 --> 00:17:52.670
and it still doesn't feel right.

00:17:54.170 --> 00:17:58.360
It's a vortex of anger, 
sadness, and self-loathing.

00:17:58.980 --> 00:18:01.720
You end up throwing all of it at them,

00:18:02.550 --> 00:18:04.350
even though they're important to you.

00:18:04.350 --> 00:18:05.600
It's tough, huh?

00:18:14.130 --> 00:18:18.060
Aa-kun suddenly ran this way, 
so I chased him here.

00:18:18.630 --> 00:18:19.620
Yeah?

00:18:28.090 --> 00:18:29.000
Good.

00:18:33.210 --> 00:18:35.260
Hm, is there something on there?

00:18:35.660 --> 00:18:36.880
Oh, no!

00:18:37.210 --> 00:18:40.640
How did that man get his hands on this?

00:18:41.000 --> 00:18:43.640
Is he a collector?

00:18:49.380 --> 00:18:53.960
Hey, Tazuki, do you remember when 
I invited you to this festival?

00:18:54.340 --> 00:18:55.270
Yeah.

00:18:55.270 --> 00:18:56.150
Of course.

00:18:56.590 --> 00:19:01.200
Why did you say we should stop getting 
involved with these creatures?

00:19:02.020 --> 00:19:03.790
It's always been on my mind.

00:19:06.840 --> 00:19:11.170
There's just one thing I can't tell you about.

00:19:12.740 --> 00:19:15.670
I was desperate to keep 
it from you at the time.

00:19:16.110 --> 00:19:20.430
I felt like I could never 
see you again if I hadn't.

00:19:21.630 --> 00:19:23.930
I told you not to get involved 
with these creatures

00:19:24.410 --> 00:19:26.660
because I might have cracked otherwise.

00:19:27.760 --> 00:19:32.670
Even if it meant lying to you, I just 
couldn't bear splitting up with you.

00:19:34.660 --> 00:19:37.850
I always thought you'd 
distanced yourself from me.

00:19:41.110 --> 00:19:44.080
People come and go, sooner or later.

00:19:44.080 --> 00:19:48.880
I've been preparing myself to 
accept it, whenever it happens.

00:19:49.610 --> 00:19:52.710
Have you been thinking 
like that the whole time?

00:19:53.410 --> 00:19:54.540
I have.

00:19:56.730 --> 00:19:58.180
I have.

00:19:58.180 --> 00:20:01.550
I knew you would be gone someday, too,

00:20:01.960 --> 00:20:03.300
so I was preparing myself.

00:20:05.330 --> 00:20:06.720
Kashiwagi...

00:20:15.230 --> 00:20:16.360
Kashiwagi!

00:20:25.340 --> 00:20:26.120
We're going to get separated.

00:20:28.250 --> 00:20:29.870
Don't suddenly stand still.

00:20:29.870 --> 00:20:31.120
You're a nuisance to the others.

00:20:31.470 --> 00:20:32.340
Right.

00:20:32.690 --> 00:20:34.730
Here, hold on to my shirt.

00:20:45.320 --> 00:20:47.740
I'm not going to leave you.

00:20:49.020 --> 00:20:51.120
How long do you think I've 
stuck around with you?

00:20:51.520 --> 00:20:53.140
Get it through your head already.

00:20:56.720 --> 00:20:57.960
Thanks.

00:20:57.960 --> 00:20:59.650
And sorry.

00:20:59.980 --> 00:21:05.160
Hey, I think I'll try to depend 
on you more from now on.

00:21:05.840 --> 00:21:06.750
Is that okay?

00:21:09.160 --> 00:21:10.680
Of course it is.

00:21:11.040 --> 00:21:12.920
That's why we're <i>us</i>.

00:21:20.010 --> 00:21:21.810
We all stand under this waterfall

00:21:21.810 --> 00:21:25.300
to cleanse our body and soul 
before we have fun at the festival.

00:21:29.600 --> 00:21:31.770
It looks nice.

00:21:31.770 --> 00:21:33.680
Want to touch it, Mii-kun?

00:21:38.490 --> 00:21:39.700
Does it feel nice?

00:21:51.640 --> 00:21:53.220
They're climbing the waterfall.

00:21:53.220 --> 00:21:57.700
They say if an inugami can climb 
a waterfall, it's all grown up.

00:21:57.700 --> 00:21:58.780
Really?

00:21:58.780 --> 00:22:00.090
Don't give up!

00:22:03.300 --> 00:22:04.840
Hey!

00:22:05.790 --> 00:22:08.010
Have you seen a suspicious man come by?

00:22:08.010 --> 00:22:10.220
A man? I haven't.

00:22:13.680 --> 00:22:14.780
Mii-kun?

00:22:15.560 --> 00:22:16.680
Mii-kun?!

00:23:50.710 --> 00:23:52.690
It's been half a year since Mii-kun arrived.

00:23:52.690 --> 00:23:56.050
There's a lot I still don't know, 
but it's fun every day.

00:23:56.430 --> 00:23:59.830
Thanks for coming to my home, Mii-kun.

00:23:59.700 --> 00:24:04.670
Final Episode
Always Together

00:24:00.370 --> 00:24:03.860
<i>How to Keep a Mummy</i>,
final episode. See you next time.

00:24:04.670 --> 00:24:07.760
<b>See you next time!</b>
